  "title": "Keep untrusted content in the data plane",
  "subtitle": "Detection adds a signal; trusted boundaries govern sources, control flow, authority, destinations, and egress.",
  "purpose": "Show several untrusted channels becoming bounded facts and proposals while source admission, policy, and egress controls prevent control-flow and data-flow abuse.",
