    "alt_text": "Untrusted user, document, web, tool-result, and memory content enters source admission and optional detection. A bounded extractor feeds a model proposal into a typed policy gateway. Trusted identity, resource state, and policy authorize the proposal. The egress gateway resolves fixed destinations and allowed fields before a bounded effect and trace."
  },
